    "字幕外观为全局默认值，进入播放器后仍可临时调整。OpenSubtitles 搜索使用官方 REST API；下载需要账户额度，API Key、用户名和密码会保存在 Keychain。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Subtitle appearance is the global default and can still be adjusted temporarily in the player. OpenSubtitles search uses the official REST API. Downloads require account quota. The API key, username, and password are stored in the Keychain."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
